On DL1 Elric spent over an hour sorting through her
possessions. She said she was not going to to the planes
burdened again. She even threw away her crystal ball and
tinning kit, only to discover later that she only had 3
?oGD, the other 2 left behind. Patience and a /oSDD had to
do for the plane of water. It was pretty uneventful until
the astral plane, and then Elric actually got scared a few
times. Even with AC-52 and MC### she was twice below 50% HP,
her Max HP were drained by Death, she was famished by Famine
and thrice sickened by Pestilence.

The problem was, her offense was pathetic. She even chose
GoP over [GoD to get the big damage bonus difference (as an
elf her strength topped out at 18). It took too long to get
a simple vampire out of the way, much less anything with
decent AC and HP. Those were just teleported away, several
wands were broken, the trick with the c?oConfuseMonster and
b?oTaming was used two or three times.

Of course it didn't help that she went to the correct altar
last. But she made it, and Bandit did, too! That's him SW
from Elric, pretty cute for a troll, huh? Everything in the
room except the other @'s are Elric's pets! Well, maybe not
the ring.

